## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to translate a health metric into concrete runtime constraints in a multi-tenant ML infra scenario.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-resource mappings
- Cache budgeting, TTLs, prefetch strategies
- Fairness guarantees and SLA preservation
- Telemetry: per-tenant hit rate, latency, CKNE trend

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-degradation loop sketch
function degradeLoop(state){
  const totalBudget = state.totalCacheMB;
  const sumCKNE = state.tenants.reduce((s,t)=>s+t.ckne,0);
  state.tenants.forEach(t=>{
    t.cacheMB = totalBudget * (t.ckne / (sumCKNE||1));
  });
}
```

